- Changed-files gate on the finished branch (node scripts/check-changed.ts 7b7c82aae2, 25 files): format, lint, knip 1/2 and 2/2, typecheck of 2 packages, 370 tests in 14 files and the React compiler check on 14 files all passed.
- Header render counts, measured with a scratch counter that is not committed, for eight modifier press-and-release pairs: with all machines 48 header renders before the memo change and 0 after; with one machine selected 64 before the scoped-snapshot cache and 0 after; with two of three machines 0.
- One integrated pass in the development client on demo data: full cards under headers, Alt-click collapse and expand, badges on collapsed headers, headers following the Manual order. No installed-client pass.

